{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sinoda is an abstract strategy game in which players attempt to win by taking each other\u2019s pieces. However, it\u2019s not the <i>number</i> of pieces that matters, but the <i>point value</i> of those pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each turn, players can move a piece <strong>OR</strong> adjust a piece\u2019s value up or down by one. The number atop each dice indicates its movement and point value. More maneuverable pieces are worth more points to opponents if captured, so plan wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game ends when:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A player loses all their pieces <strong>OR</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A player captures six opposing pieces <strong>OR</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All players have only one piece left</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the game ends the player with the highest score wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In two-player games, you can claim victory through the special \u201cWin by Sinoda\u201d condition by gaining so many points your opponent can\u2019t catch up, even if they capture all your remaining pieces. In games with three or more players, a player down to their last piece becomes pivotal, as others may protect them to prevent the leading player from ending the game for the win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mix things up with one of our five unique modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Low ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Double Action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mad King</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sinoda can be played alone against AI or with up to 6 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3475490?t=1749892601","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3475490?t=1749892601","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475490/3c6f713da2c55c572129f04e709aef23ef218378/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749892601","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475490/3c6f713da2c55c572129f04e709aef23ef218378/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749892601","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sinoda is an abstract strategy game in which players attempt to win by taking each other\u2019s pieces. However, it\u2019s not the <i>number</i> of pieces that matters, but the <i>point value</i> of those pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each turn, players can move a piece <strong>OR</strong> adjust a piece\u2019s value up or down by one. The number atop each dice indicates its movement and point value. More maneuverable pieces are worth more points to opponents if captured, so plan wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game ends when:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A player loses all their pieces <strong>OR</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A player captures six opposing pieces <strong>OR</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All players have only one piece left</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When the game ends the player with the highest score wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In two-player games, you can claim victory through the special \u201cWin by Sinoda\u201d condition by gaining so many points your opponent can\u2019t catch up, even if they capture all your remaining pieces. In games with three or more players, a player down to their last piece becomes pivotal, as others may protect them to prevent the leading player from ending the game for the win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mix things up with one of our five unique modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Low ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Double Action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mad King</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sinoda can be played alone against AI or with up to 6 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Maple Bay"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475490/5ed2907a67f2a6d33fa5691b16fb8edf8f21f3d6/header.jpg?t=1749892601","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257148018,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148018/movie480.mp4?t=1749044447","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148018/movie_max.mp4?t=1749044447"},"name":"Sinoda Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257148018/0adf270293656dd7f4a36f492d87b884b48db673/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749044447","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148018/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749044447","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148018/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749044447"}}],"name":"Sinoda","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":